    "blogtextliquid_LBJgtB": {
      "type": "blogtextliquid",
      "custom_css": [],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>There is a particular kind of pain that happens in the perfume section of a department store. You are standing at the counter, you have found something that smells incredible, and the sales assistant tells you with a completely straight face that it is £270. You do the mental maths, think about your train fare and your energy bill, and buy it anyway. Or you walk away feeling annoyed.</p><p>We tested our bestsellers side by side against the designer originals they are inspired by. Same skin, same ambient conditions, evaluated at the 15-minute mark, the 3-hour mark, and the 8-hour mark on real people across the UK.</p>"
      }
    },
