            "image_max_width": 500,
            "heading_image_gap": 16,
            "mobile_heading_image_gap": 20,
            "body_text": "<p>If you have been spending £150 or more on a bottle of fragrance and wearing it sparingly because it feels too precious for an ordinary day, a quality inspired alternative is worth trying properly. Not as a consolation prize. As a genuine everyday option.</p><p>Apply twelve seconds of unscented moisturiser before spraying to close the longevity gap completely.</p>",
